#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:9
msgid "USB Device 传输与控制"
msgstr "USB Device transfers and control"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:11
msgid "共享准入、时钟、PHY、借用与完整撤回由[USB生命周期](usb-lifecycle.md)维护。本文描述选定Device模式。"
msgstr ""
"The [USB lifecycle](usb-lifecycle.md) owns shared admission, clocks, PHY, "
"borrowing, and complete withdrawal. This page describes selected Device "
"modes."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:13
msgid "选定 ROM profile 与描述符"
msgstr "Selected ROM profile and descriptors"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:15
msgid ""
"`nexus/io/usb_profile.h` 的只读 profile 绑定既有 controller／endpoint face，以及 "
"选定的方向、类型、MPS、FIFO、PHY 时钟、速度和 PIO／AHB DMA 事实。 只有 USB 被选入且 "
"`factory.capabilities = true` 时，生成器才产生 profile、精确 endpoint 数组与 "
"`nx_factory_usb_profile` getter。设为 `false` 时不生成这些对象 或 getter；普通 USB "
"face、方法表、provider context 与既有 generic capability 类型不因此扩大。getter 不初始化硬件，也不发现新"
" endpoint。 ULPI 使用独立的高速与全速回退 profile；`nx_factory_usb_profile_for_speed` "
"只返回选定速度对应的 ROM 记录，不把高速 512 B MPS 用于全速。 公共 `NX_USB_PROFILE_INTERRUPT` 的枚举值是 "
"2，USB wire／寄存器 EPTYP 值是 3； `NX_USB_PROFILE_ISOCHRONOUS` 的枚举值是 3，wire EPTYP 为"
" 1。provider 显式映射类型， 不把两者直接强转混用。"
msgstr ""
"The read-only profile in `nexus/io/usb_profile.h` binds existing "
"controller/endpoint faces and selected direction, type, MPS, FIFO, PHY-"
"clock, speed and PIO/AHB DMA facts. Only selected USB with "
"`factory.capabilities = true` generates the profile, exact endpoint array "
"and `nx_factory_usb_profile` getter. Setting it to `false` omits those "
"objects and getter without enlarging ordinary USB faces, method tables, "
"provider contexts or existing generic capability types. The getter neither "
"initializes hardware nor discovers endpoints. ULPI has separate high-speed "
"and full-speed fallback profiles; `nx_factory_usb_profile_for_speed` returns"
" only the selected ROM record for that speed and never uses high-speed 512 B"
" MPS at full speed. Public `NX_USB_PROFILE_INTERRUPT` is 2 while USB "
"wire/register EPTYP is 3; `NX_USB_PROFILE_ISOCHRONOUS` is 3 while wire EPTYP"
" is 1. The provider maps these types explicitly rather than interchanging "
"them with a cast."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:27
msgid ""
"`nx_usb_profile_validate` 只读检查选定事实，不能证明实际时钟、PCB、VBUS 或枚举。 外部 descriptor 通过 "
"`nx_usb_descriptor_view_t` 传给 "
"`nx_usb_descriptor_validate`：device、configuration、string 必须完整；校验 "
"length／total、EP0 MPS、唯一 interface、alternate 0，以及 bulk／interrupt／ISO IN/OUT "
"endpoint 的方向／编号／类型／MPS 与选定 profile 的对应关系。interrupt 描述符的 `bInterval` 全速为 "
"1–255 个 1 ms frame，高速为 1–16 的指数编码；ISO 在两种速度下 均为 1–16 指数编码，单位分别是 1 ms frame 和"
" 125 µs microframe。interval 由外部 descriptor 独占，不复制到 TOML、IR、profile 或 "
"provider state。DCD 不调度 host poll， 也不承诺实际间隔；bulk 的既有 interval 处理保持不变。ISO "
"同步／用途字段校验标准 编码，不推导音频反馈或 class 拓扑；保留 usage／位非法时拒绝。HS 高带宽 multiplier "
"仍不支持，不静默裁剪成单 transaction。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_usb_profile_validate` checks selected facts read-only; it cannot prove "
"actual clocks, PCB, VBUS or enumeration. External descriptors reach "
"`nx_usb_descriptor_validate` through `nx_usb_descriptor_view_t`. Device, "
"configuration and string descriptors must be complete. Validation checks "
"length/total, EP0 MPS, unique interfaces, alternate 0, and correspondence of"
" bulk/interrupt/ISO IN/OUT endpoint direction, number, type and MPS to the "
"selected profile. Interrupt `bInterval` is 1–255 frames of 1 ms at full "
"speed and an exponent encoding of 1–16 at high speed. ISO uses 1–16 exponent"
" encoding at both speeds, in units of 1 ms frames or 125 µs microframes "
"respectively. The external descriptor owns the interval; it is not copied "
"into TOML, IR, profiles or provider state. The DCD neither schedules host "
"polls nor promises an actual interval; existing bulk interval handling stays"
" unchanged. ISO synchronization/usage fields receive standard-encoding "
"checks without inferring audio feedback or class topology; reserved usage or"
" bits reject. HS high-bandwidth multipliers remain unsupported and are not "
"silently reduced to one transaction."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:39
msgid ""
"选定类型不符、描述的 endpoint 未选入 profile 或 MPS 不符返回 INVALID；非零 control 与 alternate "
"setting 仍为 UNSUPPORTED，保留字段非法仍为 INVALID。 class-specific 子结构只检查边界，不解码其类语义。"
msgstr ""
"A selected-type mismatch, an endpoint absent from the selected profile or an"
" MPS mismatch returns INVALID. Nonzero control and alternate settings remain"
" UNSUPPORTED; invalid reserved fields remain INVALID. Class-specific "
"substructures receive bounds checks only, without decoding class semantics."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:43
msgid ""
"描述符校验按给定完整长度扫描，不读取硬件、不复制或保留 descriptor；通过只表示 结构合法。选择哪段描述符、处理何种请求及 class "
"内容仍属外部策略。发送后， descriptor／reply 字节必须保持有效且不变，直到 outer request 的 acquire "
"SETTLED。"
msgstr ""
"Descriptor validation scans the full supplied length without reading "
"hardware, copying descriptors or retaining them; passing establishes "
"structural validity only. Descriptor selection, request handling and class "
"content remain external policy. Once sent, descriptor/reply bytes must "
"remain valid and unchanged until the outer request's SETTLED is observed "
"with acquire semantics."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:47
msgid ""
"profile、endpoint 数组、face／ops、adapter、request 和 view／snapshot 元数据 须按其 C "
"类型自然对齐，地址范围不能回绕；非法对齐在 typed 访问前拒绝。 descriptor bytes 只需 byte "
"alignment。数值检查不证明任意地址或 opaque 私有 context 可访问；调用者仍须提供合法且保持有效的可读／可写存储。"
msgstr ""
"The profile, endpoint array, face/ops, adapter, request and view/snapshot "
"metadata must have the natural alignment of their C types, and address "
"ranges must not wrap; invalid alignment is rejected before typed access. "
"Descriptor bytes require only byte alignment. Numeric checks do not "
"establish accessibility of arbitrary addresses or opaque private contexts; "
"callers must still supply valid readable/writable storage and keep it valid."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:52
msgid "包完成与控制 epoch"
msgstr "Packet completion and control epochs"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:54
msgid ""
"prepare 不访问 payload；拒绝 admission 不保留新引用。ACCEPTED 借用 request 与 payload，直到 "
"acquire-observed SETTLED。所有 request、payload、输出、count、 immutable clock ops 和 "
"wake target 均检查与 controller/endpoint/ring/clock state 及已有 loan 的重叠。拒绝 "
"state/read_events 输出别名时输出保持原值。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare never accesses payloads; rejected admission retains no new "
"references. ACCEPTED borrows requests and payloads until acquire-observed "
"SETTLED. Requests, payloads, outputs, counts, immutable clock ops and wake "
"targets are checked against controller/endpoint/ring/clock state and "
"existing loans for overlap. Rejected state/read_events output aliases "
"preserve outputs."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:59
msgid ""
"非 ISO IN 的每次有限 data／ZLP 长度寄存器写入 `(1U << 19) | length`（PKTCNT=1）， "
"MCNT／保留高位保持零；ISO IN 同样 PKTCNT=1，但 MCNT=1，按下一节选择帧奇偶。 interrupt 不增加 odd/even-"
"frame 命令。 每个选定 IN direction 使用独立 Tx FIFO， PIO 一次同步装入整个不超过所选 MPS 的包，没有剩余软件 "
"refill 工作；TX-empty mask 保持零， 不创建 TXFE refill worker。IN FIFO 写入不是完成，只有 "
"XFRC、EP enable 已清、 FIFO 空闲容量恢复并且观察到的 W1C completion 清除读回成功才发布 SUCCESS。 OUT "
"必须同时读到包数据和 XFRC， short packet 正常完成；越界包的所有 FIFO words 都被消费，最多复制 caller "
"capacity， 之后报告 OVERFLOW 并排空，不越界写 caller buffer。"
msgstr ""
"Each finite non-ISO IN data/ZLP length register is `(1U << 19) | length` "
"(PKTCNT=1); MCNT and reserved upper bits remain zero. ISO IN also uses "
"PKTCNT=1 but sets MCNT=1 and selects frame parity as described below. "
"Interrupt adds no odd/even-frame command. Each selected IN direction has its"
" own Tx FIFO. PIO synchronously loads the complete packet, at most the "
"selected MPS, with no remaining software refill work. TX-empty masks stay "
"zero and no TXFE refill worker is created. Writing the IN FIFO is not "
"completion: SUCCESS requires XFRC, cleared EP enable, recovered FIFO free "
"capacity and successful W1C-completion clear readback. OUT must observe "
"packet data and XFRC. Short packets complete normally. For an oversized "
"packet, every FIFO word is consumed but at most the caller capacity is "
"copied; OVERFLOW then starts drain without writing beyond the buffer."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:70
msgid ""
"IN TXFE 是只读状态，不参与 W1C 清除/完成的零值证明。ITTXFE 是主机 IN token 在 FIFO 尚空时到达的可重试信息，OUT "
"STUP 是正常 SETUP phase 事实；两者不错误地终止 包。IN control timeout 和 OUT FIFO overrun "
"使用对应方向的真实事件位。EP0 的 DATA PID 由 SETUP/core 管理：bits 29:28/16 对 EP0 是 "
"reserved，软件只对非零 bulk／interrupt endpoint 使用 DATA0 命令。对这些 "
"endpoint，reset／clear-halt 须核对 DATA0 读回；失败保留 reset admission 屏障或 "
"halt，不提前允许新包借用。"
msgstr ""
"IN TXFE is read-only and does not participate in W1C clearing or zero-value "
"completion proof. ITTXFE is a retriable fact that a host IN token arrived "
"while the FIFO was empty; OUT STUP is a normal SETUP-phase fact. Neither "
"incorrectly terminates a packet. IN control timeout and OUT FIFO overrun use"
" their direction-specific event bits. SETUP/core manages the EP0 DATA PID: "
"bits 29:28/16 are reserved for EP0. Software uses DATA0 commands only for "
"nonzero bulk/interrupt endpoints. For those endpoints, reset/clear-halt must"
" prove DATA0 readback; failure retains the reset-admission barrier or halt "
"and does not admit another packet loan early."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:77
msgid ""
"SETUP 严格解码八个 little-endian bytes，并产生单调递增 epoch。新 SETUP/reset 使旧 control loan"
" 进入排空，不能仅改 epoch 就撤销借用。reset 与 queued SETUP 在同一 snapshot 中没有先后证明，先前 queued "
"SETUP 被丢弃；reset 在旧 loan 排空和 FIFO flush 后， 还须显式屏蔽并清除选定非零方向的 active，读回成功才清 "
"`reset_pending`。 失败保留 reset 屏障和 clock，由 service 或完整 stop 继续恢复。新 admission 仍须"
" 满足 endpoint 的实际启用条件。SET_ADDRESS 验证 当前标准 SETUP 的各字段，先 staged，只有对应 status-IN "
"实际 XFRC 后写 DCFG 地址。地址读回失败关闭 controller。"
msgstr ""
"SETUP strictly decodes eight little-endian bytes and produces a "
"monotonically increasing epoch. A new SETUP/reset drains the old control "
"loan; changing the epoch alone cannot revoke borrowing. Reset and queued "
"SETUP in the same snapshot have no proven ordering, so earlier queued SETUP "
"is discarded. After draining old loans and flushing FIFOs, reset must also "
"explicitly mask and deactivate selected nonzero directions. Only successful "
"readback clears `reset_pending`. Failure retains the reset barrier and "
"clock, with recovery continuing through service or complete stop. New "
"admission must still meet actual endpoint enable conditions. SET_ADDRESS "
"validates every field of the current standard SETUP and stages the address; "
"it writes the DCFG address only after the corresponding status-IN actually "
"reaches XFRC. Failed address readback closes the controller."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:86
msgid ""
"STM32F407 总线 reset 清除非零 endpoint 的 USBAEP，模型保留这个硬件事实。 生产路径仍在 loan 排空后显式清除非零 "
"active／mask 并核对读回，不仅依赖 reset 事件来证明平台后置条件。完成 reset 后仍需以新当前 epoch 显式 "
"enable；reset／clear-halt／submit 均不自动激活。对 inactive 非零 endpoint， submit 返回 "
"STATE，prepared request 保持 READY，没有新 request／buffer 借用或 FIFO 写入。EP0 control "
"保留既有合同；DATA0 恢复、reset 事件或 controller 未 closing 均不能证明外部 configuration 已提交。"
msgstr ""
"STM32F407 bus reset clears USBAEP on nonzero endpoints; the model retains "
"this hardware fact. After draining loans, the production path still "
"explicitly clears nonzero active/mask state and verifies readback, rather "
"than relying solely on the reset event to prove platform postconditions. "
"After reset completion, enable still requires an explicit new current epoch."
" Reset/clear-halt/submit never activate automatically. Submitting to an "
"inactive nonzero endpoint returns STATE and leaves the prepared request "
"READY, without a new request/buffer loan or FIFO write. EP0 control retains "
"its existing contract. DATA0 restoration, a reset event or a controller not "
"being closing does not prove that an external configuration committed."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:94
msgid ""
"事件环保存 value facts，满时不覆盖旧事件；精确软件 loss marker 排在原队列后。 最新 SETUP/epoch/closing "
"状态不依赖事件环空间。时间戳是 IRQ acquisition time， 不是 USB 总线采样时刻；reset 批次中的无序旧 SETUP "
"不计作新的已接收 control。"
msgstr ""
"The event ring retains value facts without overwriting old events when full;"
" exact software-loss markers follow existing queue contents. Latest "
"SETUP/epoch/closing state does not depend on ring space. Timestamps are IRQ "
"acquisition times, not USB bus sampling times; unordered old SETUP in reset "
"batches is not counted as newly received control."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:98
msgid "ISO 有限单包与帧边界"
msgstr "Finite ISO packets and frame boundaries"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:100
msgid ""
"`transfer=\"isochronous\"` 沿用现有 packet request、调用者 payload 与唯一 controller "
"owner。每次 submit 从实际 DSTS 选择下一 frame／microframe 的奇偶；FS 使用 11-bit 帧计数，HS 使用 "
"14-bit 计数。ULPI 必须先观察到 ENUMERATED speed，才能提交 ISO。 每次提交的剩余 Core deadline "
"至多一秒，小于两种速度帧半环的 1.024 秒。收集 incomplete 事实时先检查 Core 超时，避免长停顿把旧目标误判成未来；Core 与 "
"SOF 之间不建立时间换算。"
msgstr ""
"`transfer=\"isochronous\"` reuses the existing packet request, caller "
"payload and sole controller owner. Each submit reads actual DSTS to select "
"the next frame/microframe parity: FS uses an 11-bit frame count and HS a "
"14-bit count. ULPI must first observe an ENUMERATED speed before admitting "
"ISO. Each submission has at most one second of remaining Core deadline, less"
" than the 1.024-second frame half-ring at either speed. Incomplete-fact "
"collection checks Core timeout first so a long execution stall cannot "
"misidentify an old target as future. No conversion between Core time and SOF"
" is established."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:107
msgid ""
"IN 以单个 transaction 提交，OUT 的硬件接收计划为一个 MPS packet。ISO 的控制位 28／29 表示 even／odd "
"frame，不表示 DATA toggle，不执行 bulk 的 DATA0 重置证明。 ISO endpoint 的 STALL 操作返回 "
"UNSUPPORTED，不写端点寄存器。ISO 没有 ACK／NAK 握手；SUCCESS 只证明控制器完成且必要源、FIFO、AHB 和 IRQ "
"引用已撤回，不能证明 host 或其应用已收到数据。周期调度、同步、用途和 class 策略由外部 owner 明确提供， 不自动重试错过的机会，也不按"
" `bInterval` 创建数据泵。"
msgstr ""
"IN submits a single transaction; the OUT hardware receive plan is one MPS "
"packet. ISO control bits 28/29 select even/odd frames rather than DATA "
"toggle, so the bulk DATA0-reset proof does not apply. STALL on an ISO "
"endpoint returns UNSUPPORTED without an endpoint-register write. ISO has no "
"ACK/NAK handshake. SUCCESS proves only controller completion and withdrawal "
"of the required source, FIFO, AHB and IRQ references; it cannot prove "
"receipt by the host or its application. An explicit external owner supplies "
"periodic scheduling, synchronization, usage and class policy. Missed "
"opportunities are not retried automatically, and no data pump is created "
"from `bInterval`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:114
msgid ""
"已有未清的 global incomplete／drop 事实会在新 admission 前拒绝。ISOODRP（bit14）、 incomplete "
"IN／OUT（bit20／21）只使已到机会的 active ISO borrow 进入 IO 排空， 不取消仍属未来帧的请求，也不影响其它 bulk "
"borrow；已观察到的真实完成优先于并发旧 incomplete。取消、超时、reset 和 stop 都继续实际 drain，失败仍保留 "
"request／payload 并可进入 QUARANTINED，不能强制释放借用。"
msgstr ""
"Uncleared global incomplete/drop facts reject before new admission. ISOODRP "
"(bit14) and incomplete IN/OUT (bit20/21) begin IO drain only for an active "
"ISO borrow whose opportunity has arrived. They do not cancel requests for "
"future frames or affect another bulk borrow; an observed real completion "
"takes precedence over a concurrent old incomplete indication. Cancellation, "
"timeout, reset and stop still perform actual drain. Failure retains the "
"request/payload and may enter QUARANTINED; the borrow cannot be forcibly "
"released."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:120
msgid ""
"软件参考位于 `tests/integration/assemblies/usb_iso_assembly/`，分别覆盖 FS 最大 IN、HS "
"core 内置 PHY 的全速 OUT 和 ULPI HS DMA。这些 ISO 参考不验证远程唤醒，也不提供完整 USB 音视频 class "
"或物理吞吐／时序资格；远程唤醒使用下述独立合同。"
msgstr ""
"Software references in `tests/integration/assemblies/usb_iso_assembly/` "
"cover maximum FS IN, full-speed OUT on the HS core with its internal PHY, "
"and ULPI HS DMA. These ISO references do not validate remote wake or provide"
" a complete USB audio/video class or physical throughput/timing "
"qualification; remote wake follows the separate contract below."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:124
msgid "非零 endpoint 显式 activation"
msgstr "Explicit nonzero endpoint activation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:126
msgid ""
"独立的 `nexus/io/usb_activation.h` 提供 `nx_usb_activation_port_t`：face 是共享 只读 "
"ops 与既有 controller context 两指针，只提供一个同步 `nx_usb_activation_set(port, epoch, "
"endpoint_address, active)` 操作。生成的 "
"`nx_factory_usb_activation(nx_usb_device_id_t)` 返回选定 controller 的静态借用 "
"face，非法或不支持的 identity 返回 NULL；查找不初始化硬件、不 retain clock。 生成独立于 "
"`factory.capabilities`，不要求启用 ROM profile，不改变既有 USB ops、 "
"profile或face布局。该机制不新增可变controller／endpoint 状态、队列、worker、实例池、动态分配、TOML 字段或 IR"
" 类型。两指针布局说明 face 形状；实际只读保留成本、未引用 GC 与完整镜像成本须分别以对应 ARM ELF 确认。"
msgstr ""
"The separate `nexus/io/usb_activation.h` provides "
"`nx_usb_activation_port_t`. Its face consists of two pointers: shared read-"
"only ops and the existing controller context. It provides only the "
"synchronous operation `nx_usb_activation_set(port, epoch, endpoint_address, "
"active)`. Generated `nx_factory_usb_activation(nx_usb_device_id_t)` returns "
"a static borrowed face for the selected controller; invalid or unsupported "
"identities return NULL. Lookup neither initializes hardware nor retains a "
"clock. Generation is independent of `factory.capabilities`, does not require"
" a ROM profile, and leaves existing USB ops, profile, and face layouts "
"unchanged. The mechanism adds no mutable controller/endpoint state, queue, "
"worker, instance pool, dynamic allocation, TOML field, or IR type. The two-"
"pointer layout describes the face shape; actual retained read-only cost, "
"garbage collection of unreferenced sections, and full-image cost must each "
"be confirmed with the corresponding ARM ELF."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:136
msgid ""
"操作只面向已经选定的非零 endpoint 某一个方向：FS engine 为 EP1–EP3，HS engine 为 EP1–EP5；拒绝两个 EP0"
" 地址及保留／未选地址。OUT 可为 bulk、interrupt 或通过 FIFO 准入的 ISO，各速度 MPS 按选中 profile "
"限定。调用者须是同一个 序列化特权 Task，进入时 incoming IRQ masks clear。controller 须 started、持有 "
"clock、没有 closing／reset 屏障，参数 `epoch` 等于最新权威软件 control/reset epoch；冷态 epoch 0"
" 合法。无效 identity 或已知旧软件 epoch 在 MMIO 前拒绝。软件检查通过后，已观察到的 raw USBRST "
"也使本次调用在写入前返回 STATE。尚未采集的物理 SETUP/reset 仍可能随后发生， IRQ 临界区不提供总线原子性；stop/restart"
" 后外部须丢弃旧缓存的 epoch。"
msgstr ""
"The operation applies to one direction of an already selected nonzero "
"endpoint: EP1–EP3 on the FS engine and EP1–EP5 on the HS engine. Both EP0 "
"addresses and reserved or unselected addresses reject. OUT may be bulk, "
"interrupt or ISO that passes FIFO admission; each speed's MPS is constrained"
" by the selected profile. The caller must be the same serialized privileged "
"Task with incoming IRQ masks clear. The controller must be started, retain "
"its clock and have no closing/reset barrier. The `epoch` argument must equal"
" the latest authoritative software control/reset epoch; cold epoch 0 is "
"valid. Invalid identities and already-known stale software epochs reject "
"before MMIO. After software checks pass, an observed raw USBRST also returns"
" STATE before writes. A physical SETUP/reset not yet acquired may still "
"arrive later; the IRQ guard is not a wire-atomic transaction. External "
"callers must discard cached epochs after stop/restart."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:146
msgid ""
"目标方向必须没有 request loan、disable 工作、EPENA、待确认的定义事件或尚未完成的 SETUP 清理。IN 还要求专用 FIFO"
" 全空且没有 flush；OUT 要求共享 RX status FIFO 空。 否则返回 BUSY，不暗中取消请求、消费其他方向的 RX "
"或释放其存储。前置检查返回 INVALID／CONTEXT／STATE／BUSY 时没有硬件写入，不建立新 loan；激活本身从不借用 request "
"或 payload，不能代替已有 packet 的 cancel／drain／acquire SETTLED。"
msgstr ""
"The target direction must have no request loan, disable work, EPENA, "
"unacknowledged defined event or unfinished SETUP cleanup. IN also requires "
"its dedicated FIFO fully free and no flush; OUT requires the shared RX "
"status FIFO empty. Otherwise the operation returns BUSY without implicitly "
"cancelling requests, consuming another direction's RX or releasing its "
"storage. INVALID/CONTEXT/STATE/BUSY preflight rejection performs no hardware"
" writes and creates no new loan. Activation itself never borrows a request "
"or payload and cannot replace an existing packet's cancel/drain/acquire "
"SETTLED."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:152
msgid ""
"冷启动仅使两个 EP0 方向 active 并解除其 endpoint mask；其余选定方向保留 immutable 几何但 "
"inactive／SNAK。使能一个 inactive 方向时，先按选定 MPS、wire 类型和仅 IN 的 FIFO selector 配置目标，清"
" STALL、置 active 与 SNAK；bulk／interrupt 同时建立 DATA0，ISO 不使用 DATA toggle。保持 "
"EPENA clear，不写 TSIZ 或 payload FIFO。 核对稳定控制字段、适用的 DATA0 与 NAK 状态， "
"仅处理命令后新出现的目标 IN NAK-effective／token-empty 提示（0x50），并证明其 W1C "
"清除；其他新事件使本次操作失败，进入 partial IO／closing。调用前已有的 定义事件仍返回 BUSY，不在前置拒绝中清除。随后解除目标 "
"EP_MASK 位并读回完整 预期 mask。OUT 不写 reserved TxFIFO 字段。active、传输使能与 IRQ mask "
"是三个独立条件；mask 或 active 单独成立均不代表已经接受一个包。"
msgstr ""
"Cold start activates and unmasks only the two EP0 directions. Other selected"
" directions retain immutable geometry but remain inactive/SNAK. Enabling an "
"inactive direction first applies its selected MPS and wire type and the FIFO"
" selector for IN only, clears STALL and sets active/SNAK. Bulk/interrupt "
"additionally establishes DATA0; ISO does not use DATA toggle. EPENA stays "
"clear; neither TSIZ nor the payload FIFO is written. The operation proves "
"stable control fields, applicable DATA0 and NAK state, then handles only new"
" target IN NAK-effective/token-empty hints (0x50) arising after the command "
"and proves their W1C clear. Any other new event fails the operation with "
"partial IO/closing. Defined events already present on entry still return "
"BUSY and are not cleared during preflight rejection. It then unmasks the "
"target EP_MASK bit and reads back the complete expected mask. OUT never "
"writes reserved TxFIFO fields. Active state, transfer enable and IRQ masking"
" are independent conditions; a mask or active bit alone does not mean a "
"packet was admitted."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:163
msgid ""
"反激活之前，外部必须实际 cancel／drain 并 acquire 目标 packet 的 SETTLED。 操作先屏蔽目标方向且核对其他 mask"
" 位未变，再设置 SNAK、清 active 并核对。 每次仅修改对应方向，保留其他 endpoint 和两个 EP0 位，物理 "
"vector／priority route 不变；不 flush 共享 RX、不重置 controller、不停止 clock，也不开始传输。 Task"
" 显式操作在既有有限 poll budget 内等待控制／W1C 读回，每项命令只发一次； reset progress "
"新增的反激活步骤只单次观察，由后续 service 继续，不在 IRQ 引入 此 Task 等待循环。"
msgstr ""
"Before deactivation, the external owner must actually cancel/drain and "
"acquire SETTLED for the target packet. The operation first masks the target "
"direction and proves other mask bits unchanged, then sets SNAK, clears "
"active and reads back the result. Each call changes only its direction, "
"preserving other endpoints and both EP0 bits; physical vector/priority "
"routing stays fixed. It neither flushes shared RX, resets the controller, "
"stops the clock nor starts a transfer. Explicit Task operations wait for "
"control/W1C readback within the existing finite poll budget, issuing each "
"command once. The added reset-progress deactivation step makes one "
"observation and relies on later service to continue; it does not introduce "
"this Task wait loop into IRQ execution."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:171
msgid ""
"幂等调用必须先满足同样的无 loan／无 pending 前置条件。已经 active 的 enable 先核对 immutable "
"几何，不重放控制寄存器配置，只按需修正目标 mask；重复 enable 不得重置 bulk／interrupt 的 DATA1、清除真实 HALT "
"或发送包。已经 inactive 的 disable 不重新编程几何，只证明目标 mask 关闭及事件清除。只有显式 disable 后重新 "
"enable 才为 bulk／interrupt 建立新 DATA0 并在读回成功后清 halt；disable 保留其 PID。 已 active 但"
" immutable 几何损坏时返回 IO／closing，不通过重写控制寄存器掩盖错误。"
msgstr ""
"Idempotent calls require the same no-loan/no-pending preflight. Enable on an"
" already active direction first validates immutable geometry, does not "
"replay control-register configuration and only repairs the target mask if "
"needed. Repeated enable must not reset bulk/interrupt DATA1, clear a real "
"HALT or send a packet. Disable on an already inactive direction does not "
"reprogram geometry; it only proves the target mask is off and events are "
"clear. Only explicit disable followed by enable establishes fresh DATA0 for "
"bulk/interrupt and clears halt after successful readback; disable preserves "
"their PID. Corrupt immutable geometry on an active direction returns "
"IO/closing without concealing the fault by rewriting control registers."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:179
msgid ""
"控制或 mask 写入后的读回失败返回 IO，并保留既有 `closing` 屏障；IO 可以已有 部分硬件效果，不能作为无操作拒绝。只对目标 "
"best-effort mask／inactive 回滚， 若观察到 EPENA 意外为一，不能假装写零已完成 disable。失败不能通过重试 "
"activation 清 closing；外部须继续推进其他 loan 并执行显式完整 stop。stop 仍可能 BUSY， 在既有 "
"disable／flush／IRQ join 证明完成前保留 clock 与 caller storage。"
msgstr ""
"Failed readback after a control or mask write returns IO and retains the "
"existing `closing` barrier. IO may already have partial hardware effects; it"
" is not a no-operation rejection. Best-effort mask/inactive rollback affects"
" only the target. If EPENA is unexpectedly observed set, writing zero cannot"
" pretend disable has completed. Retrying activation cannot clear closing. "
"The external owner must continue progressing other loans and perform "
"explicit full stop. Stop may still return BUSY, retaining the clock and "
"caller storage until existing disable/flush/IRQ-join proofs complete."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:185
msgid ""
"外部 Chapter 9/configuration owner 根据配置或 alternate 选择方向，先 cancel／ "
"drain／disable 旧方向，再 stage 新方向，随后提交该请求的 STATUS IN。这与 ST 手册及参考 Zephyr 的 "
"before-status 顺序一致，不强制解释为 ACK 后才可激活。 外部仅在对应实际 STATUS 完成且仍满足当前事务条件后发布 "
"configured readiness， 此前自行阻止普通非零 packet admission。多次 setter 不是配置事务：后续失败、 新 "
"SETUP supersede 或 status 失败时，外部须撤销已经成功的 staging 或显式 stop； 不能用平台 rollback "
"撤销主机已观察到的 ACK。去配置也须先实际排空／反激活， 再按外部 deadline 与拒绝策略决定是否接受；DCD 不解码 "
"configuration value。"
msgstr ""
"The external Chapter 9/configuration owner chooses directions for the "
"configuration or alternate setting, cancels/drains/disables old directions, "
"stages new directions and then submits STATUS IN for that request. This "
"matches the before-status sequence in the ST manual and reference Zephyr; it"
" does not impose activation only after ACK. The external owner publishes "
"configured readiness only after actual corresponding STATUS completion and "
"while the current transaction conditions still hold, and must gate ordinary "
"nonzero packet admission beforehand. Several setter calls are not a "
"configuration transaction. On a later failure, superseding SETUP or failed "
"status, the owner must undo successful staging or explicitly stop. Platform "
"rollback cannot revoke an ACK already observed by the host. Deconfiguration "
"also requires actual drain/deactivation before the external "
"deadline/rejection policy decides whether to accept; the DCD does not decode"
" configuration values."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:194
msgid ""
"activation 补充既有 FIG-16 的显式控制调用，不新增生命周期 owner 或执行线程。 它不提供 Chapter 9／class "
"stack、CDC notification、多配置／alternate 策略、 连续传输或电气接入；ISO packet、HS、DMA、Host "
"和角色由各自独立选入路径提供。 activation机制不证明物理枚举/reset时序、整平台停止或HIL。"
msgstr ""
"Activation supplements the explicit control calls in existing FIG-16 without"
" adding a lifecycle owner or execution thread. It provides no Chapter "
"9/class stack, CDC notification, multiple-configuration/alternate-setting "
"policy, continuous transfers, or electrical integration. ISO packets, HS, "
"DMA, Host, and roles come from their separately selected paths. The "
"activation mechanism does not establish physical enumeration/reset timing, "
"whole-platform stopping, or HIL."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:199
msgid "可选 EP0 packetizer 与外层借用"
msgstr "Optional EP0 packetizer and outer borrow"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:201
msgid ""
"`nexus/components/usb_control.h` 使用调用者零初始化的 `nx_usb_control_t`，内部 只有两个固定的 "
"packet request 槽；outer `nx_usb_control_request_t` 与 payload "
"也由调用者提供。profile／face 的生命周期覆盖整个绑定的 adapter。应用独占 EP0 packet 使用权；event ring "
"消费、class 分派及 controller 的恢复／停止仍由外部 owner 管理。现有 [FIG-16 I/O "
"装配与执行图](../../diagrams.md) 的 face→provider 是包层调用；EP0 组件由应用执行者显式推进，不增加生命周期 "
"owner。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus/components/usb_control.h` uses a caller-provided, zero-initialized "
"`nx_usb_control_t` containing only two fixed packet request slots; callers "
"also provide the outer `nx_usb_control_request_t` and payload. The "
"profile/faces must remain valid for the entire lifetime of the bound "
"adapter. The application has exclusive use of EP0 packets; external owners "
"still manage event-ring consumption, class dispatch and controller "
"recovery/stop. The face→provider edge in the existing [FIG-16 I/O assembly "
"and execution diagram](../../diagrams.md) represents packet-layer calls; the"
" application executor explicitly advances the EP0 component, which adds no "
"lifecycle owner."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:208
msgid ""
"prepare 同样仅允许 Task 调用；其余 adapter API 还要求同一个序列化特权 Task 执行，incoming IRQ masks "
"须 clear；不允许第二 Task、ISR 或 callback 重入。 initialize 不启动硬件；prepare 不借用 "
"payload，`nx_usb_control_begin` 按当前 权威 SETUP epoch 准入，成功才建立 outer "
"借用，且本身不提交包。IN 发送 min(length, wLength)，OUT 容量必须覆盖 wLength；请求、控制存储与 payload "
"须满足公共头文件的对齐和不重叠合同。 `nx_usb_control_step` 每步至多一次 poll／权威 state 读取，再执行至多两次 "
"submit 或一次 cancel；为 DATA IN 先取得同 epoch 的零长 STATUS OUT，再提交 IN。 只检查两个固定 packet"
" 槽，不在一步内循环完成多包事务，不创建 worker。 调用者在 suspend、cancel 或停机期间仍负责推进。"
msgstr ""
"Prepare permits Task calls only. Other adapter APIs require the same "
"serialized privileged Task with incoming IRQ masks clear; a second Task, ISR"
" or callback must not reenter. Initialize does not start hardware; prepare "
"borrows no payload. `nx_usb_control_begin` admits the authoritative SETUP "
"epoch and establishes the outer borrow on success without submitting a "
"packet. IN sends min(length, wLength); OUT capacity covers wLength. "
"Requests, control storage and payload meet the public alignment and non-"
"overlap contract. Each `nx_usb_control_step` performs at most one "
"poll/authoritative-state read, then at most two submits or one cancel. DATA "
"IN first prearms zero-length STATUS OUT for the same epoch, then submits IN."
" It checks only two fixed packet slots, does not loop through a multi-packet"
" transaction in one step and creates no worker. The caller continues "
"progress during suspend, cancel and shutdown."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid "事实"
msgstr "Fact"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid "允许的结论与后续责任"
msgstr "Permitted conclusion and subsequent responsibility"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid "一个 inner packet acquire SETTLED"
msgstr "SETTLED observed with acquire semantics for one inner packet"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid "仅该包的 provider 已结束访问；DATA ACK 不完成整个 control 事务，也不返还 outer payload"
msgstr ""
"Only that packet's provider has finished accessing it; DATA ACK neither "
"completes the entire control transaction nor returns the outer payload"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid "DATA 全部结束"
msgstr "All DATA has finished"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid ""
"IN 按 MPS 分包，短于 wLength 且恰好落在 MPS 边界时发送必要的 DATA ZLP；OUT 进入 DATA_READY，尚不发送 "
"STATUS IN"
msgstr ""
"IN is split into MPS-sized packets and sends the required DATA ZLP when it "
"is shorter than wLength and ends exactly on an MPS boundary; OUT enters "
"DATA_READY without sending STATUS IN yet"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid "对应 STATUS 包真实 ACK"
msgstr "Actual ACK of the corresponding STATUS packet"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid ""
"确定该 outer 事务的线上结果；已 acquire 的 STATUS ACK 先于后来观察到的 epoch、closing 或超时，但两个 "
"packet 方向及其 DMA／FIFO／IRQ 借用都退出后才发布 outer SETTLED"
msgstr ""
"Determines the outer transaction wire outcome. An acquired STATUS ACK "
"precedes subsequently observed epoch changes, closing or timeout, but outer "
"SETTLED is published only after both packet directions and their "
"DMA/FIFO/IRQ borrows have withdrawn"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid "SET_ADDRESS staging 成功"
msgstr "Successful SET_ADDRESS staging"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:0
msgid ""
"仅暂存地址；STATUS IN 的实际 ACK 与 DCFG 地址写入／读回分别成立，线上成功不保证地址或外部 configuration 已提交"
msgstr ""
"Only the address is staged; actual STATUS IN ACK and the DCFG address "
"write/readback are established separately. On-wire success does not "
"guarantee that the address or external configuration has been committed"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:226
msgid ""
"`nx_usb_control_out_view` 只在同 epoch 的 DATA_READY 且没有 provider packet 引用时， 提供"
" const 检查视图；outer 借用继续，视图在下一次同 owner adapter 调用时失效， 不能修改、释放或跨 Task "
"传递。外部策略检查内容后调用 `nx_usb_control_approve`： true 才允许下一步 STATUS IN，false 请求对旧事务 "
"STALL。审批包含在原绝对 monotonic deadline 内；已被软件观察到的新 epoch 不接受旧事务的拒绝决定。"
msgstr ""
"`nx_usb_control_out_view` provides a const inspection view only in "
"DATA_READY for the same epoch with no provider packet references. The outer "
"borrow continues; the view expires at the next adapter call by the same "
"owner and must not be modified, freed or passed across Tasks. External "
"policy inspects the contents and then calls `nx_usb_control_approve`: true "
"permits STATUS IN at the next step, while false requests STALL for the old "
"transaction. Approval must occur within the original absolute monotonic "
"deadline; a rejection decision for an old transaction is not accepted once "
"software has observed a new epoch."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:232
msgid ""
"拒绝路径使用选定 ROM profile 的 `setup_decision`：它是一个 "
"`nx_usb_setup_decision_port_t`，仍由共享只读 ops 与既有实例 context 构成两指针 "
"face。`nx_usb_setup_reject` 在同一 IRQ 临界区内检查预期的已发布软件 SETUP "
"epoch、pending／closing 及两个 EP0 方向没有 active provider packet，再执行 STALL "
"命令并核对读回；旧 generic USB 方法表和 provider context 不增加字段。旧 epoch 的决定不对已观测的新软件事务产生 "
"STALL 效果。这是已观测软件 epoch 的序列化合同，不是 USB 总线的物理原子事务。IRQ 尚未采集的 SETUP、主机重试和真实 wire "
"时序仍需实板验证；outer request 的借用不因拒绝、epoch 更新或临界区退出而撤销。"
msgstr ""
"The rejection path uses the selected ROM profile's `setup_decision`, a by-"
"value `nx_usb_setup_decision_port_t` two-pointer face formed from shared "
"read-only ops and the existing instance context. Within one IRQ critical "
"section, `nx_usb_setup_reject` checks the expected published software SETUP "
"epoch, pending/closing state, and the absence of active provider packets in "
"both EP0 directions; it then issues the STALL command and verifies readback."
" No fields are added to the existing generic USB method table or provider "
"context. A decision for an old epoch cannot STALL a newly observed software "
"transaction. This is a serialization contract for observed software epochs, "
"not a physical atomic transaction on the USB bus. SETUP packets not yet "
"collected by the IRQ, host retries and actual wire timing still require "
"hardware verification; rejection, epoch changes or leaving the critical "
"section do not revoke the outer request's borrow."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:240
msgid ""
"地址策略显式调用 `nx_usb_device_address`，并在 step 刷新后检查权威 device state； "
"`nx_usb_control_snapshot` 只复制最近一次已获取的 state，不替代刷新，也不返还借用。 设备地址、closing 与外部 "
"configuration readiness 不能从 outer SUCCESS 推断。"
msgstr ""
"Address policy explicitly calls `nx_usb_device_address` and checks "
"authoritative device state after step refreshes it. "
"`nx_usb_control_snapshot` only copies the most recently acquired state; it "
"neither replaces a refresh nor returns the borrow. Device address, closing "
"and external configuration readiness cannot be inferred from outer SUCCESS."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:244
msgid ""
"新 SETUP/reset 的 epoch、cancel、timeout 或 device stop 都不撤销旧借用。adapter 先 "
"acquire/fold 已完成 packet，再观察新 epoch。零长 STATUS OUT 的有效 XFRC 关闭线上 control "
"admission，但不是尚未停止的 IN／OUT DMA、FIFO 或 IRQ 退出证明； AHB "
"busy、地址拒清或另一方向未结清时继续保留两个槽及 outer payload。已经取得 STATUS ACK 后不再发下一 DATA IN；只 "
"join 旧方向再发布 outer SETTLED，不伪造 额外 ACK 或重放 payload。描述符、outer "
"request、adapter、profile 和 endpoint face 全程保持有效，outer 结束仍不替调用者 join 独立 "
"observer。"
msgstr ""
"New SETUP/reset epochs, cancellation, timeout and device stop do not revoke "
"old borrows. The adapter acquires/folds completed packets before observing a"
" new epoch. A valid zero-length STATUS OUT XFRC closes wire control "
"admission but does not prove withdrawal of pending IN/OUT DMA, FIFO or IRQ "
"references. AHB busy, refused address clearing or an unsettled peer "
"direction retain both slots and the outer payload. After STATUS ACK is "
"acquired, no next DATA IN is submitted. Join the old directions before outer"
" SETTLED without inventing another ACK or replaying payload. Descriptors, "
"the outer request, adapter, profile and endpoint faces remain valid "
"throughout. Outer completion still does not join independent observers."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:252
msgid ""
"如果 OUT0 packet 进入 QUARANTINED，adapter 暴露 `NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP` 并继续保留 outer "
"借用。只有外部 controller owner 能授权 `nx_usb_device_stop`；adapter 不自动停止共享 "
"controller，不用 reset 或重初始化冒充排空。owner 执行实际完整停止 后仍须继续 step，以 acquire packet "
"终态并结束旧 outer；缺少证明时继续保留存储。"
msgstr ""
"If an OUT0 packet enters QUARANTINED, the adapter exposes "
"`NEEDS_DEVICE_STOP` and retains the outer borrow. Only the external "
"controller owner can authorize `nx_usb_device_stop`; the adapter does not "
"automatically stop a shared controller or substitute reset or "
"reinitialization for drain. After the owner performs an actual full stop, it"
" must continue stepping to acquire the packet's terminal state and finish "
"the old outer request; storage remains retained without the required proof."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:257
msgid "可选 CDC ACM 控制子集"
msgstr "Optional CDC ACM control subset"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:259
msgid ""
"`nexus/components/usb_acm.h` 使用调用者零初始化、自然对齐的 `nx_usb_acm_t`， 其中包含一个既有 EP0 "
"packetizer、一个 outer request 和七个 wire bytes。 调用者显式提供 communication interface "
"number、初始 line coding 和控制意图； 不创建实例池、任务、数据泵、UART 绑定或新的 controller/endpoint "
"face。provider 仍共享只读 ops；未引用 `Nexus::USBACM` 不保留类实例或 archive 代码。 外部 "
"dispatcher 独占安排 EP0 使用，并先处理标准请求和其他 interface/class。 class-specific "
"descriptor、capability 宣告、configuration readiness 和应用授权 继续由外部工程负责；通用 "
"descriptor helper 不验证 ACM 类语义。外部若宣告相关 class "
"capability，必须补足其全部必需的请求／notification 合同，不能仅凭这个 控制子集声称完整 CDC 合规。"
msgstr ""
"`nexus/components/usb_acm.h` uses caller-zero-initialized, naturally aligned"
" `nx_usb_acm_t` storage containing one existing EP0 packetizer, one outer "
"request and seven wire bytes. The caller explicitly supplies the "
"communication interface number, initial line coding and control intent; no "
"instance pool, task, data pump, UART binding or new controller/endpoint face"
" is created. Providers still share readonly ops; without a reference to "
"`Nexus::USBACM`, no class instance or archive code is retained. The external"
" dispatcher exclusively schedules EP0 use and handles standard requests and "
"other interfaces/classes first. Class-specific descriptors, capability "
"declarations, configuration readiness and application authorization remain "
"external responsibilities; the generic descriptor helper does not validate "
"ACM class semantics. An external project advertising a class capability must"
" provide all its required request/notification contracts; this control "
"subset alone does not establish complete CDC compliance."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:270
msgid ""
"仅支持 `SET_LINE_CODING`、`GET_LINE_CODING`、`SET_CONTROL_LINE_STATE` 和 "
"`SEND_BREAK`。`bmRequestType` 必须分别是 OUT `0x21` 或 GET 的 IN `0xa1`， `wIndex` "
"必须完整等于选定 interface number；line coding 的 `wValue` 为零且 `wLength` 恰为 "
"`7`，control-line 与 break 的 `wLength` 为零，control-line 只允许 DTR/RTS "
"两位。未知或字段不符的请求通过已有 software-epoch guarded reject 明确 STALL；如果 guarded reject "
"返回 BUSY/STATE/IO 等错误，不能声称 拒绝已经执行。外部不应将其他合法类请求误派给这个窄子集。"
msgstr ""
"Only `SET_LINE_CODING`, `GET_LINE_CODING`, `SET_CONTROL_LINE_STATE` and "
"`SEND_BREAK` are supported. `bmRequestType` must be OUT `0x21`, or IN `0xa1`"
" for GET. The complete `wIndex` must equal the selected interface number. "
"Line coding requires zero `wValue` and `wLength` of exactly `7`; control-"
"line and break requests require zero `wLength`, and control-line permits "
"only the two DTR/RTS bits. Unknown requests or malformed fields are "
"explicitly stalled through the existing software-epoch guarded rejection. If"
" guarded rejection returns an error such as BUSY/STATE/IO, rejection cannot "
"be reported as completed. External dispatch must not misroute other valid "
"class requests to this narrow subset."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:278
msgid ""
"`SET_LINE_CODING` 先接收七字节暂存到 DATA_READY， `nx_usb_acm_pending` "
"仅复制值供外部检查。线编码的共享格式检查只接受非零 rate、 stop bits `0..2`、parity `0..4` 与 data bits "
"`5/6/7/8/16`；实际 UART 能力与 产品策略可更窄。short DATA 或非法字段不能获批，但仍可显式拒绝。 control-"
"line/break 请求在获批前不准入 STATUS。所有 mutation 都必须由同一 序列化特权 Task 显式 "
"`nx_usb_acm_approve`；true 仅准许后续 STATUS，不提前 修改 committed 状态或应用物理线路。审批包含在原绝对 "
"monotonic deadline 内。"
msgstr ""
"`SET_LINE_CODING` first receives seven staged bytes into DATA_READY; "
"`nx_usb_acm_pending` copies values only for external inspection. Shared "
"line-coding format checks accept only nonzero rate, stop bits `0..2`, parity"
" `0..4` and data bits `5/6/7/8/16`; actual UART capabilities and product "
"policy may be narrower. Short DATA or malformed fields cannot be approved, "
"but may still be explicitly rejected. Control-line/break requests do not "
"admit STATUS before approval. Every mutation requires explicit "
"`nx_usb_acm_approve` from the same serialized privileged Task. True permits "
"subsequent STATUS only; it neither changes committed state nor applies "
"physical lines early. Approval remains within the original absolute "
"monotonic deadline."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:286
msgid ""
"只有对应 outer acquire SUCCESS、即真实 STATUS ACK 后，组件才提交批准的 软件意图并更新 "
"`committed_epoch`。新 SETUP/reset/cancel 按既有 packetizer 规则排空，不撤销借用；未获得 outer "
"SUCCESS 的终态不提交。cancel 成功只请求 排空：若撤回 endpoint 前，对应 STATUS 仍获真实 ACK，outer "
"acquire SUCCESS 仍提交已批准的原 epoch 意图。已经 acquire 的 STATUS ACK 不被后来的 "
"SETUP/reset、closing 或 state 读取失败撤销，紧接的 GET 返回已提交的新 line coding。reset 后是否恢复 "
"初始类状态是外部 owner 的独立策略。每次 `nx_usb_acm_step` 最多推进一次既有 packetizer，沿用本节 "
"packetizer 的一次 poll／state 与有界 submit／cancel 预算； 外部仍须在取消、超时、suspend "
"和停机期间继续推进并保留所有 storage。 OUT0 quarantine 仍须外部 controller owner 授权真实完整停止，组件不自动"
" stop。"
msgstr ""
"Only after the matching outer acquire SUCCESS, meaning a real STATUS ACK, "
"does the component commit approved software intent and update "
"`committed_epoch`. New SETUP/reset/cancel drains under the existing "
"packetizer rules without revoking borrows; a terminal outcome without outer "
"SUCCESS does not commit. Successful cancellation only requests drain: if the"
" matching STATUS still receives a real ACK before endpoint withdrawal, outer"
" acquire SUCCESS still commits the approved original epoch intent. An "
"already acquired STATUS ACK is not revoked by later SETUP/reset, closing or "
"a failed state read; an immediately following GET returns the newly "
"committed line coding. Whether reset restores initial class state is "
"separate external owner policy. Each `nx_usb_acm_step` advances the existing"
" packetizer at most once, preserving the packetizer's per-step bounds of one"
" poll/state read and bounded submits/cancellation. The external executor "
"must continue progress and retain all storage during cancellation, timeout, "
"suspend and shutdown. OUT0 quarantine still requires the external controller"
" owner to authorize real complete stop; the component does not stop it "
"automatically."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:297
msgid ""
"外部在每次 step 后、派发下一请求前读取 snapshot，按新的 `committed_epoch` 应用 UART 参数、DTR/RTS 或 "
"break，并独立处理应用失败与恢复；snapshot 不是事件队列， 软件提交不证明外设已应用。`SEND_BREAK` 仅记录 "
"`0`（停止）、`0xffff`（无限期）或 有限毫秒意图，不建计时器、不自动清除，也不证明物理 break。控制子集不提供 bulk "
"数据搬运、serial-state notification、完整 CDC 枚举、其他类或物理资格。"
msgstr ""
"After each step and before dispatching the next request, the external owner "
"reads the snapshot and uses a new `committed_epoch` to apply UART "
"parameters, DTR/RTS or break, with separate responsibility for application "
"failures and recovery. The snapshot is not an event queue, and software "
"commit does not prove peripheral application. `SEND_BREAK` records only `0` "
"(stop), `0xffff` (indefinite) or a finite millisecond intent; it creates no "
"timer, performs no automatic clearing and does not prove physical break. The"
" control subset provides no bulk data movement, serial-state notification, "
"complete CDC enumeration, other classes or physical qualification."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:303
msgid "Device 显式远程唤醒"
msgstr "Explicit Device remote wakeup"

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:305
msgid ""
"F407 的固定 Device 及 managed Role 的 Device 阶段均可显式选择 "
"`remote_wakeup=true`。静态配置仅接入 可选 runtime，不自动发信号，也不创建任务、定时器或等待线程。描述符是否声明 "
"remote wake、Chapter 9 请求是否合法及业务何时需要唤醒，仍由外部控制 owner 决定。"
msgstr ""
"F407 fixed Device and the Device phase of a managed Role can explicitly "
"select `remote_wakeup=true`. Static configuration only wires the optional "
"runtime; it neither signals automatically nor creates tasks, timers or "
"waiting threads. The external control owner remains responsible for "
"advertising remote wake in descriptors, validating Chapter 9 requests and "
"deciding when the application needs to wake the host."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:310
msgid ""
"`remote_wakeup` 同时选择静态 runtime 与对应协议代码。Host 从同一 typed IR 推导 构建选择，SoC "
"私有编译常量裁剪未选的协议算法；公共请求、方法表和数据布局 保持同一合同。未选功能通过原接口报告 UNSUPPORTED，通用 USB、DMA／IRQ "
"排空 以及 cold 元数据安全检查继续执行。Native 完整模型只在相关 USB target 选择 功能以运行全部合同；固件的 Flash／RAM"
" 成本按同源配置与编译器的 ELF 计量。"
msgstr ""
"`remote_wakeup` selects both static runtime storage and the corresponding "
"protocol code. Host configuration tools derive build selection from the same"
" typed IR; SoC-private compile-time constants remove unselected protocol "
"algorithms while public requests, method tables and data layouts retain the "
"same contract. An unselected feature reports UNSUPPORTED through the "
"existing interface. Generic USB, DMA/IRQ drain and cold-metadata safety "
"checks continue to run. The complete Native model selects the feature only "
"for relevant USB targets to exercise all contracts. Firmware Flash/RAM costs"
" are measured from an ELF with the same source configuration and compiler."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:316
msgid ""
"DCD 只在精确 Device `SET_FEATURE(DEVICE_REMOTE_WAKEUP)` 的 STATUS IN 真正 ACK "
"后锁存许可；`CLEAR_FEATURE` 同样在 ACK 后生效。RESET 与成功 SET_CONFIGURATION 清除旧许可。新的 SETUP"
" 取消尚未 ACK 的修改意图；公开 `state.remote_wakeup_enabled` 只报告已提交值。ST bridge 在新 SETUP "
"前用此值同步 Core，GET_STATUS 不会报告被取消的 SET／CLEAR intent。线上 STATUS ACK 立即提交 权限，与该 "
"packet 的 DMA 内存 join 分开；应用已 cancel 或 deadline 到期也不能 撤销真实已 ACK 的协议作用。AHB、地址或 "
"EPDISD 未会合时，原 packet 仍被借用。"
msgstr ""
"DCD latches permission only after a real STATUS IN ACK for the exact Device "
"`SET_FEATURE(DEVICE_REMOTE_WAKEUP)` request; `CLEAR_FEATURE` also takes "
"effect only after ACK. RESET and successful SET_CONFIGURATION clear the old "
"permission. A new SETUP cancels modification intent not yet ACKed; public "
"`state.remote_wakeup_enabled` reports only committed values. The ST bridge "
"synchronizes Core from this value before processing a new SETUP, so "
"GET_STATUS never reports cancelled SET/CLEAR intent. A wire STATUS ACK "
"commits permission immediately, independently of that packet's DMA-memory "
"join. Application cancellation or an expired deadline cannot revoke a real "
"ACKed protocol effect. If AHB, address withdrawal or EPDISD has not joined, "
"the original packet remains borrowed."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:324
msgid ""
"调用者静态提供 `nx_usb_remote_wakeup_request_t`，用 Core prepare 设置有限绝对 "
"`deadline`，并提供正的 `max_service_delay_us`，记为 B。B 必须覆盖信号保持期间的 调度、抢占、IRQ "
"屏蔽及撤信号延迟之和，范围为 1..12998 µs；填写参数不会证明此 上界。准入还要求真实硬件 SUSPSTS、首次 suspend 观察与当前有效"
" System epoch 相同，并已等待至少 5001 µs；这一 tick 余量覆盖整数微秒相位。效果前检查剩余 budget 严格大于 "
"`2001+B` µs。拒绝不保留 request，也不触发 RWUSIG。"
msgstr ""
"The caller statically supplies `nx_usb_remote_wakeup_request_t`, uses Core "
"prepare to set a finite absolute `deadline`, and supplies a positive "
"`max_service_delay_us`, denoted B. B must cover the sum of scheduling, "
"preemption, IRQ masking and signal-withdrawal delays during the pulse, "
"within 1..12998 µs; setting the parameter does not prove this bound. "
"Admission also requires actual hardware SUSPSTS, the first suspend "
"observation in the same currently live System epoch, and at least 5001 µs "
"elapsed. This tick guard covers the phase hidden by integer-microsecond "
"samples. Before any effect, remaining budget must be strictly greater than "
"`2001+B` µs. Rejection neither retains the request nor asserts RWUSIG."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:331
msgid ""
"SUCCESS 表示 ACCEPTED。调用者按已证明的 B 在已有事件循环或任务中执行 service， 约 2 ms 后撤回并读回 "
"RWUSIG，才发布 SETTLED。控制器分别保留断言前后时间界： 后界证明最低保持，前界检查上限，避免断言后抢占被一次迟到时间采样隐藏。满足 "
"Core 时间与 B 合同时，物理脉冲处于 USB 要求的 1..15 ms；实际超窗必须报告错误， 之后撤回成功也不能把它改写成 "
"SUCCESS。成功只证明本端信号已撤回，host resume 仍由真实 WKUPINT／RESUME 事实发布。本地 pulse 后没有 host "
"resume 时，不重用旧 suspend 起点；只有前次 SUSP W1C 已读回完成、之后又观察到新的 SUSP，才建立下一 次 5001 µs "
"idle 收条。撤不掉的旧状态位不能反复授权发送。"
msgstr ""
"SUCCESS means ACCEPTED. The caller runs explicit service in its existing "
"event loop or task under the proved B delay bound, withdrawing and reading "
"back RWUSIG after approximately 2 ms before publishing SETTLED. The "
"controller retains separate pre-assertion and post-assertion time bounds: "
"the latter proves minimum hold, while the former checks the upper limit, "
"preventing preemption after assertion from being hidden by one late time "
"sample. When Core time and B meet their contracts, the physical pulse stays "
"within USB's required 1..15 ms. An actual violation must report an error; "
"later successful withdrawal cannot turn it into SUCCESS. Success proves only"
" local signal withdrawal. Host resume is still published from real "
"WKUPINT/RESUME facts. Without host resume after a local pulse, the old "
"suspend start is not reused. A new 5001 µs idle receipt requires successful "
"readback of the previous SUSP W1C clear followed by a newly observed SUSP. "
"An uncleared old status bit cannot authorize repeated signaling."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:340
msgid ""
"cancel 与 stop 保留已接纳的请求，不能提前缩短最低保持。读回拒绝保持 QUARANTINED、runtime 和 clock 责任，后续 "
"service／stop 只能凭真实撤回完成 join。 可返回的 epoch／时间异常尽力撤信号并报告错误；Core 自身的终态 fail-stop "
"不保证 还会返回执行清理，不能据此承诺无界 CPU 停机后的 15 ms 上限。epoch 异常路径仅 针对 System 时间域失效而 USB "
"寄存器域与保留的 clock receipt 仍有效；不能将未知 USB gate／PHY 失电后的读回零当作真实退出证明。"
msgstr ""
"Cancel and stop retain the accepted request and cannot shorten minimum hold."
" Refused readback retains QUARANTINED storage, runtime and clock "
"responsibility; subsequent service/stop can complete join only through "
"actual withdrawal. When an epoch/time fault returns control, the driver "
"makes a best-effort signal withdrawal and reports an error. A terminal fail-"
"stop of Core itself does not guarantee returning to perform cleanup, so no "
"15 ms upper bound may be promised after an unbounded CPU halt. The epoch-"
"fault path only covers loss of the System time domain while the USB register"
" domain and retained clock receipt remain valid. Zero readback after an "
"unknown USB gate state or PHY power loss is not proof of actual withdrawal."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:347
msgid ""
"managed Role 的 Device face 直接转交同一个 DCD，不建立第二套 pulse 状态或 owner。 角色退出先调用同一 "
"stop 排空；最低保持尚未结束或 RWUSIG 撤回拒绝时，仍保留 原 Device transport、clock 与 pin receipt。可选"
" runtime 以及请求必须避开整个 composite，包括暂时 inactive 的 Host 状态与 channel storage、cold "
"配置、VBUS GPIO face／ops、共享 pins 数组、逐 pin snapshot 和端点 plan。已知尺寸范围在 C 准入时检查；外部 "
"GPIO context 没有可知尺寸，由调用者保证它与 runtime／request 均不别名。模式开放以精确 provider "
"支持矩阵和当前软件证据为准，不从共用 C 头 推导电气资格。"
msgstr ""
"The Device face of a managed Role forwards directly to the same DCD, without"
" a second pulse state or owner. Role exit first drains through the same "
"stop. While minimum hold is incomplete or RWUSIG withdrawal is refused, the "
"original Device transport, clock and pin receipt remain retained. The "
"optional runtime and request must be disjoint from the entire composite, "
"including temporarily inactive Host state and channel storage, cold "
"configuration, VBUS GPIO face/ops, shared pin arrays, per-pin snapshots and "
"endpoint plans. C admission checks ranges whose sizes are known. Because the"
" external GPIO context size is unknown, the caller must ensure it aliases "
"neither runtime nor request. Mode availability follows the exact provider "
"support matrix and current software evidence; a shared C header does not "
"establish electrical qualification."

#: ../../../../../../docs/reference/contracts/io/usb-device.md:356
msgid ""
"维护的 F407 ARM ABI 中，普通 controller 仍为 160 B，可选指针填入原有 padding； 未选 runtime RAM 为"
" 0 B，选中 runtime 为 32 B，调用者请求为 32 B。共享 ops 和 函数的 Flash 成本另按实际链接镜像计量，不能把这组 RAM"
" 数字称为零 Flash 开销。 主机模型与 ARM 链接分别证明软件行为和资源，物理脉宽／WCET 仍需实板测量。"
msgstr ""
"In the maintained F407 ARM ABI, the ordinary controller remains 160 B; the "
"optional pointer occupies existing padding. Unselected runtime RAM is 0 B, "
"selected runtime is 32 B and the caller-owned request is 32 B. Shared ops "
"and function Flash costs are measured separately in the actual linked image;"
" these RAM figures must not be described as zero Flash overhead. Host models"
" and ARM links establish software behavior and resources respectively. "
"Physical pulse widths and WCET still require board measurements."
